 "topic": "Steal a whole ATM: fit a winch at a Mod Shop (or take a tow truck from a police impound), back up to an outdoor ATM, hook it and drive off to rip it out of the wall; the cash is marked (Dye Pack Jammer needed) and goes to a fence; some ATMs pay over $10,000",
